ves the highest signal efficiency without exceeding the trigger rate.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "call_id": "call_JnYw1Qx36sPySbkw0jNeIird", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_0a5b394a2ca82f93006afceee616e887d0be46cb2240d47a97", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
